已批准长线骨架：{{ input_pack.longline_core | tojson(indent=2) }}

已批准StoryRoom前序：{{ input_pack.approved_story_room | tojson(indent=2) }}

复杂度：{{ input_pack.complexity_profile | tojson(indent=2) }}

